              "paw·ned² team builds, read AND written. File → “Export to paw·ned²” offers three scopes: the whole team build (variants included), the first 8 characters, or one lock; a lock's Export submenu offers the same output. The format only carries professions, attributes and 8 skills: names, equipment, notes and locks do not follow. paw·ned² always writes 8 slots — below that Z-Codex pads with empty slots, above it writes as many as needed."),
